VoidCrawl adds the Chrome sandbox bootstrap syscall set documented by the
GoogleChrome Lighthouse CI Docker guidance:
https://googlechrome.github.io/lighthouse-ci/docs/recipes/docker-client/#docker-permissions

The added rule is intentionally exact and regression-tested. Keep this pinned
profile reviewed when rebasing it onto a newer Docker default; do not broaden
it, replace it with seccomp=unconfined, or grant CAP_SYS_ADMIN.
